                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I absolutely love this game. The humour is fantastic, the music is great, most everything is fully voiced, there's some very familiar voice actors in this game. Graphically, despite it's age, it holds up REALLY well. I find the combat familiar, and fun. I've picked it up after a while to give it another run through just because I enjoy the universe, and I'm a bit hyped for Divinity III... it'll scratch that isometric RPG, strategy combat type itch if you have one.",
